                  <h2 className="text-4xl md:text-8xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6 md:mb-8 tracking-tighter leading-tight italic">Choose your <br/><span className="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-rose-500 to-amber-500">creative domain.</span></h2>
                  <p className="text-lg md:text-2xl text-slate-400 font-medium">Select the path that matches your professional soul.</p>
